menu "SPI NAND"

config SPI_NAND
    bool "SPI NAND flash"
    default n
    help
      Enable the Bouffalo SPI NAND driver and Dhara FTL, using
      SPI/GPIO. Supports polling SIO and 512-byte logical sectors.

config NAND_FLASH_VERIFY_WRITE
    bool "Read back and verify NAND page writes"
    default n
    depends on SPI_NAND
    help
      Enable physical-page readback verification after programming.

endmenu
